sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant API as CN CMD SYS API
    participant CMD as CMD System

    Client->>API: POST /api/customer/{customerId}/claim/xml
    Note over API: Extract customerId from URI
    API->>CMD: POST /{customerId}/claim/xml (XML Request)
    Note over CMD: Process professional claim
    CMD->>API: Response (XML/JSON)
    Note over API: Transform response to JSON
    API->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over API,CMD: External Integration: CMD System for Professional Claims
    Note over API: Error handling via global error handler
